    "detailed_description": "<i>Jump, jump, jump</i>, jump small steps, take a rainbow bath in the final toilet, and you will enter the next level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> How to play: </h2>You can move left and right, jump, and the length of time the jump key is pressed determines the height of your jump, no need to consider the charge. Enemies can be trampled upon falling, if this enemy can be trampled to death. If the wall allows climbing, you can jump against the wall. Press the up and down keys to climb the ladder, and the space bar to jump off the ladder.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227150/extras/61cd407971f7f1a484a6e27b0e61933d.webp?t=1580629004\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227150/extras/4a7cbfb5c3fc0a11a34db25601c7add7.avif?t=1580629004\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227150/extras/b52def4e420d3a0d5f55ee2ffa0306cf.poster.avif?t=1580629004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227150/extras/b52def4e420d3a0d5f55ee2ffa0306cf.webm?t=1580629004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227150/extras/b52def4e420d3a0d5f55ee2ffa0306cf.mp4?t=1580629004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Refreshing jumping, don't be careful.<br></li><li> Rough lines, simple environment, this is a game full of fragrance.<br></li><li> Take good time, sometimes it takes a little advance or sprint.<br></li><li> Limited life, can not die indefinitely, if the resurrection number is used up, the game is over.<br></li><li> Pick 100 gold coins to get a chance to resurrect.<br></li><li> Not all enemies can be trampled to death.<br></li><li> Each level has different terrains and institutions, it is important to grasp the timing. </li></ul>",
